{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:32 2026-10-28 HKT<br/>發佈時間：21:32 2026-10-28 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：21:32 2026-10-28 HKT</p><img alt=\"「怡傲錢莊」落飛得手\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/1ec419c7f98ec1931705682d25516daa/2026-10/r5_7.jpg\"/><p>近季周俊樂表現雖突出，但原來其泥戰成績卻平平，對上三季更每季僅在泥地交出一W，之前一次在泥地贏馬已數到本年四月一日勝出「贏得自然」。</p><p>今晚周俊樂終憑第五場游廄「怡傲錢莊」在泥地贏馬，打破逾半年未勝泥地的悶局，閘前此馬W賠率更着啡格至5.6倍開跑，結果飛到馬到。</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f58e49acf09ab9a7293c240d0cb73a0d/2026-10/1d6b5fc2-82de-4fac-9feb-e562e74cc0cd.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/33dd562d93f4711a44978e2c55838832/2026-10/2f9e372e-1908-4a6c-af82-7eb64052aa76.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/35d51ba4c6013afa2d8f63c10a4053ea/2026-10/5b1cd46a-b1e9-44fb-8735-bed3a6993895.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ed11a85d203bec242d7618bdd19a1255/2026-10/5ccb9e42-4ec9-4ae1-9971-5f7ce84fa47b.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ce4cacfe02b123e555728b2323109248/2026-10/5f0f7ae8-4ec2-4b3e-9389-7a0c6dbda0fe.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4bfc9ef4e399daf33eade5962fc5b5aa/2026-10/6e3fc6eb-6056-4821-adb5-411679989449.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ec202269167ec7f1751a05031dd6dd02/2026-10/7f499548-70c5-45bf-922c-9ee693fd0cec.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e47739583c1cc60d74d108601577cb11/2026-10/9b2e18c5-ee47-4501-a9a2-81c492b97706.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2a98bea0bfac8f1f26ea08a345410808/2026-10/9e508f94-4982-40ad-bdec-710fcd70c8fe.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d4071537ed3041cc1d967d8d93a2fc5d/2026-10/51f63c69-10a8-47a3-9f7b-aecff925b4bc.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/513fa3be1f86fac733fca602fb05803d/2026-10/1172dcdd-2eaa-4cce-8863-14865a5889cb.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0